{"v":4,"catch":"從龍手中拯救「Ceim」王國！","desc":"《RASTAN SAGA》是TAITO於1987年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制主角Rastan小偷，打敗狂暴的龍，換取Ceim王國的寶藏！\n用你的劍跳躍和砍殺，在各個階段中前進，充分利用沿途的武器、盔甲和物品。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-05-02","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/84c9dd65b5fc9de5f613abbf951d9c4d21373d5324a025ab9c7c82e9bee8235f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e1c5eb63c79e80e60bd6fdcd1534d0b36f0ca594ac19b4d32f23376f9c69a021.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8f82e1c7d866cb886b28f0fbd3768703a9eba59d93fcec3aa4882674c1ba0ca2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2a745107296453e25311904e00af6859b79f03a9620b40e37887715d776cc612.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8fc41c05bdb8c51e56ad1f1bf8ff535734425c1084a267c37512645d6e56969.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65d82d0aa8191e9b90d38410676b682b0c3d785264446266bdb386c7aed480e9.jpg"],"titleId":"01008b101de10000","dlc":[]}